  "ruleText": "CHAPTER Mirt 300 REQUIREMENTS FOR LICENSURE - REPEALED\n\nREVISION NOTE:\n\nThe Board of Medical Imaging and Radiation Therapy was established pursuant to 2016, 54:2, effective 7-1-16, with rulemaking authority under RSA 328-J:7.\n\nDocument #13329, effective 1-22-22, adopted or readopted with amendments various rules in Chapter Mirt 300.\n\nDocument #13329 adopted the following rules:",
